  "scope": "Fabric-first native content regression through the current integrated research, alchemy, equipment, foci, golems, devices and Warp groups. All authored Fabric wrappers are required. R11 unknown knowledge, R12 clues/entity scans, server research settings, Repair/Haste, Bore repair, Ward behaviour, Excavation Silk/Dowsing, Growth/Fertility, Deconstruction and Brainy/Giant zombies are included. This is not full TC4 parity; remaining content, inspected client presentation, multiplayer/survival and NeoForge remain pending. Added native runic shield/augmentation, special combat foci and shock fields, UNSTABLE/orbs/Pearl, cheat sheet, Firebat/Wisp, scan callback API/retargeting and administrator commands. Their authored scenarios are required; passing is not inspected client or full gameplay parity. Added original object-tag API consumers, HUNGRY nodes, Hellbat, native accessories/amulets/runic upgrades, FocusPouch and coloured candles, Pech/curse/ManaBeans, seven crystal clusters, Advanced Furnace and loot bags. Native chunk unload and resource custody checks are required; pending client inspection/natural magical biomes and remaining content stay explicit. Original warp delta packets, native HUD notifications, Pech subtype scanning and exact legacy-loot-potion/runic recipe integration are required. Added actual Traveller boots, Hover Harness fuel/menu/permission custody, original RP/discovery/research notifications, Knowledge Fragments and passive Primal Charm inventory consumers; client presentation remains uninspected. Added actual Taint blocks/falling mobs, spiders/spores/swarm/tentacles, Primal focus/orb/node factory, PURE/DARK/TAINTED ecology, Silverwood knots and natural magical/eerie/taint biome generation. New client presentation remains uninspected; full port acceptance remains pending. Added actual Arcane Spa, native Classic purifying fluids, Bath Salts expiry/Ward, native Fabric fluid transactions/menu, Sanity Soap and Crimson Rites. Client presentation remains uninspected. Original Pure bucket source pickup, placement, durable container overflow and native Fabric transfer are required. Added the new content wave GameTest scenarios: the eldritch bestiary, the cultist faction, the tainted animals and the taint seeds, the champion system, the eldritch blocks and tiles, the Outer Lands dimension and labyrinth, the village components, the new projectiles, the device containers, the new equipment and relic items and the runic accessories. Their authored scenarios are required; the new content is exercised on a real dedicated server, the inspected client presentation and the full TC4 parity stay pending. The survival-progression acceptance of wave two is required as well: the chain of the first iron wand to the loot of an Outer Lands boss, the closure of every mod ingredient on a natural world source, the purchasability of the research of the chain with the points the player earns, the proof that nothing of the chain needs creative mode or a fixture, the reachability of the Outer Lands through the original oculus and the primordial pearl of the original boss. Their authored scenarios are required; passing is not inspected client presentation nor full TC4 parity.",
